 for consumer price index (CPI) inflation of 4 per cent within a band of +/- 2 per cent, while supporting growth.</p>", "raw_html_excerpt_utf8_sha256": "dcaa3579acfd43935039c4b82b78fd45be91e2d7cdbdbec61f83da93bddb75be"}, {"source_id": "rbi_prid_60686", "source_url": "https://www.rbi.org.in/Scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=60686", "raw_path": "raw/rbi_prid_60686.html", "snapshot_absolute_path": "/var/folders/wh/rvj5dycx0zgbk951gfhl9jb80000gn/T/rbi_source_doublecode_oct08_rti8uqqx/raw/rbi_prid_60686.html", "source_
sample rbi_mpc_2026-10-07 {"meeting_id": "rbi_mpc_2026-10-07", "meeting_number": 63, "meeting_start_date": "2026-10-05", "decision_date": "2026-10-07", "minutes_source_id": null, "resolution_source_id": "rbi_prid_63742", "committee": {"rate_delta_bps": 25, "repo_rate_percent": 5.5, "stance": "calibrated tightening", "outcome_evidence": [{"source_id": "rbi_prid_63742", "source_url": "https://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=63742", "raw_path": "raw/rbi_prid_63742.html", "snapshot_absolute_path": "/var/folders/wh/rvj5dycx0zgbk951gfhl9jb80000gn/T/rbi_source_doublecode_oct08_rti8uqqx/raw/rbi_prid_63742.html", "source_sha256": "082252ec277abd6f8e43eee9dc48a77326ffa9430dd2193ee936796144d3cf0d", "publication_date": "2026-10-07", "evidence_kind": "paragraph", "zero_based_p_index": 3, "raw_character_start": 34979, "raw_character_end_exclusive": 35461, "excerpt": "2. After a detailed assessment of the evolving macroeconomic and financial developments and the outlook, the MPC voted unanimously to increase the policy repo rate under the liquidity adjustment facility (LAF) by 25 bps to 5.50 per cent. Consequently, the standing deposit facility (SDF) rate stands adjusted at 5.25 per cent and the marginal standing facility (MSF) rate and the Bank Rate at 5.75 per cent. The MPC also decided to change the stance to calibrated tightening.", "raw_html_excerpt": "<p>2. After a detailed assessment of the evolving macroeconomic and financial developments and the outlook, the MPC voted unanimously to increase the policy repo rate under the liquidity adjustment facility (LAF) by 25 bps to 5.50 per cent. Consequently, the standing deposit facility (SDF) rate stands adjusted at 5.25 per cent and the marginal standing facility (MSF) rate and the Bank Rate at 5.75 per cent. The MPC also decided to change the stance to calibrated tightening.</p>", "raw_html_excerpt_utf8_sha256": "42ca1f38fc980a80a8d27ffda83eb345d0fdb894ec4981d80dbf68d562efc947"}, {"source_id": "rbi_prid_6